`FoundationEmbeddingExtractor.extract_recording` embeds one recording the BIDS loader read, one result per condition, and `coco_pipe.io.embeddings_up_to_date` tells whether a recording's files already hold its windows with the settings of files written for another recording, so a resubmitted job skips it before extraction. `write_recording_embeddings(skip_up_to_date=True)` keeps such files instead of replacing them, and the writer takes the loader's comma-separated `bad_channels`.
